  Agent Concurrency
  Applies to this session only; config.toml is unchanged.

  1. 1            Primary agent only; delegation cannot run concurrently.
  2. 2            Primary agent plus up to 1 concurrent sub-agent.
  3. 3            Primary agent plus up to 2 concurrent sub-agents.
› 4. 4 (current)  Primary agent plus up to 3 concurrent sub-agents.
  5. 6            Primary agent plus up to 5 concurrent sub-agents.
  6. 8            Primary agent plus up to 7 concurrent sub-agents.
  7. 12           Primary agent plus up to 11 concurrent sub-agents.
  8. 16           Primary agent plus up to 15 concurrent sub-agents.

  Press enter to confirm or esc to go back
